d 2 cyanocob(III)alamin + 2 apo-[cyanocobalamin reductase] + NADPH +H(+)"],"label":"cyanocobalamin reductase","obo_id":"EC:1.16.1.6","type":"class"},{"iri":"https://www.enzyme-database.org/query.php?ec\u003d1.16.1.6","ontology_name":"ec","related_synonyms":["NADPH:cyanocob(III)alamin oxidoreductase (cyanide-eliminating)","cyanocobalamin reductase (NADPH, cyanide-eliminating)","cyanocobalamin reductase (NADPH; CN-eliminating)","cyanocobalamin reductase (cyanide-eliminating)"],"ontology_prefix":"EC","short_form":"EC_1.16.1.6","description":["2 cob(II)alamin-[cyanocobalamin reductase] + 2 hydrogen cyanide + NADP(+)\u003d 2 cyanocob(III)alamin + 2 apo-[cyanocobalamin reductase] + NADPH +H(+)"],"label":"cyanocobalamin reductase","obo_id":"EC:1.16.1.6","type":"individual"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBA_2042384","ontology_name":"oba","ontology_prefix":"OBA","short_form":"OBA_2042384","description":["The amount of a cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase when measured in blood serum."],"label":"amount of cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase in blood serum","obo_id":"OBA:2042384","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["blood serum cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase amount","cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase amount in blood serum","level of cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase in blood serum"]},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBA_2081814","ontology_name":"oba","ontology_prefix":"OBA","short_form":"OBA_2081814","description":["The amount of a cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase (human) when measured in cerebrospinal fluid."],"label":"amount of cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase (human) in cerebrospinal fluid","obo_id":"OBA:2081814","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["cerebrospinal fluid cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase (human) amount","cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase (human) amount in cerebrospinal fluid","level of cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase (human) in cerebrospinal fluid"]},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0033787","ontology_name":"go","related_synonyms":["NADPH2:cyanocob(III)alamin oxidoreductase (cyanide-eliminating) activity","NADPH:cyanocob(III)alamin oxidoreductase (cyanide-eliminating) activity","cob(I)alamin, cyanide:NADP+ oxidoreductase activity","cyanocobalamin reductase (NADPH, cyanide-eliminating) activity","cyanocobalamin reductase (NADPH; CN-eliminating) activity","cyanocobalamin reductase activity"],"ontology_prefix":"GO","short_form":"GO_0033787","description":["Catalysis of the reaction: cob(I)alamin + hydrogen cyanide + NADP+ \u003d cyanocob(III)alamin + H+ + NADPH."],"label":"cyanocobalamin reductase (cyanide-eliminating) (NADP+) activity","obo_id":"GO:0033787","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C127118","ontology_name":"ncit","ontology_prefix":"NCIT","short_form":"NCIT_C127118","description":["A quadruple mixture composed of the corticosteroid dexamethasone, the aminoglycoside antibiotic gentamicin, the vitamin cyanocobalamin (vitamin B12), and the local anesthetic agent procaine, with antimucositic activity. Upon oral administration of the cyanocobalamin/dexamethasone/gentamicin/procaine formulation, the active ingredients prevent or inhibit inflammation and infection of the oral mucosa and reduce the associated pain. This may prevent or treat radiation-induced oral mucositis (OM)."],"label":"Cyanocobalamin/Dexamethasone/Gentamicin/Procaine Formulation","obo_id":"NCIT:C127118","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["Cyanocobalamin/Dexamethasone/Gentamicin/Procaine Formulation","Cyanocobalamin/Dexamethasone/Gentamicin/Procaine Oral Formulation","Quadruple Mixture"]},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C203798","ontology_name":"ncit","ontology_prefix":"NCIT","short_form":"NCIT_C203798","description":["Cyanocobalamin reductase / alkylcobalamin dealkylase (282 aa, ~32 kDa) is encoded by the human MMACHC gene. This protein is involved in cobalamin transport and the decyanation of cyanocob(III)alamin (cyanocobalamin, CNCbl) to yield cob(II)alamin and cyanide and the dealkylation of alkylcob(III)alamins using a thiolate of glutathione to generate cob(I)alamin and the corresponding glutathione thioether."],"label":"Cyanocobalamin Reductase / Alkylcobalamin Dealkylase","obo_id":"NCIT:C203798","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["Alkylcobalamin:Glutathione S-Alkyltransferase","CblC","Cyanocobalamin Reductase (Cyanide-Eliminating)","Cyanocobalamin Reductase / Alkylcobalamin Dealkylase","EC 1.16.1.6","EC 2.5.1.15","MMACHC","Methylmalonic Aciduria and Homocystinuria Type C Protein"]},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C76049","ontology_name":"ncit","ontology_prefix":"NCIT","short_form":"NCIT_C76049","description":[],"label":"Cyanocobalamin Co-60","obo_id":"NCIT:C76049","type":"class","exact_synonyms":["CYANOCOBALAMIN CO-60","Cyanocobalamin (60Co)","Cyanocobalamin Co-60","Rubratope-60"]},{"iri":"http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/C061902","ontology_name":"mesh","related_synonyms":["CNCb-b-carboxylic acid"],"ontology_prefix":"mesh","short_form":"mesh_C061902","description":[],"label":"cyanocobalamin-b-monocarboxylic acid","obo_id":"mesh:C061902","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/C061904","ontology_name":"mesh","related_synonyms":["CNCb-e-carboxylic acid"],"ontology_prefix":"mesh","short_form":"mesh_C061904","description":[],"label":"cyanocobalamin-e-monocarboxylic acid","obo_id":"mesh:C061904","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://snomed.info/id/102812008","ontology_name":"snomed","ontology_prefix":"SNOMED","short_form":"SNOMED_102812008","description":[],"label":"Cyanocobalamin renal clearance","obo_id":"","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://snomed.info/id/130211003","ontology_name":"snomed","ontology_prefix":"SNOMED","short_form":"SNOMED_130211003","description":[],"label":"Cyanocobalamin reductase (NADPH, cyanide-eliminating)","obo_id":"","type":"class"},{"i